{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"a1a0040a558f559e79085c6067d4a581f449a7eca5cc3bec627528de63ed7f0c","slug":"computation-evidence","location":"/foundations/computation-evidence.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"计算证据：电脑算出来，为什么还要问“怎么算的”？","content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"上海市怒江中学怒江战队","family":"上海市怒江中学怒江战队"},"name":"上海市怒江中学怒江战队","id":"contributors-Users\\limen\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\codex-gh-pages-5be28b6730164feeb69a85066295083f\\book\\myst-generated-uid-0"}],"keywords":["数学学术展评","初中数学","机器人避障","图论","Jupyter Book"],"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"computation-evidence.md","url":"/nujiang-math-exhibition-book/build/computation-evidence-b6042752cf964eb08b42fc724e3c2d7e.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"电脑很快，但“很快”不是证明。要把计算变成研究证据，必须把任务边界、算法、精度和复核方式都说清楚。","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"yFznFckJbV"}],"key":"FFvD5cDwq6"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"四种常见计算任务","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"OE9SvBbWtt"}],"identifier":"id","label":"四种常见计算任务","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"WaZozZWCd8"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 模拟","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"qS6ICYaio4"}],"identifier":"id-1","label":"1. 模拟","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"WbgnIdekXB"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"给定一套机器人动作，程序按时间推进，画出轨迹并估计最小距离。模拟擅长发现危险时刻和帮助理解，但若只每隔一小段时间采样，可能漏掉两个采样点之间的碰撞。","position":{"start":{"l